<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/hsCodes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The [Harmonized System (HS)](https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx) of tariff nomenclature is an internationally standardized system of names and numbers, defined by the World Customs Organization, used to classify traded products."@en .
